	"_note": "Sakurazaka, the village's east part (added 2026-11-01): the road on from the village climbs east to the mine, lined with cherry trees, over a creek on a plank bridge (floor tiles over the water, stone lanterns at its ends). North of the road the Hanami teahouse (noren, raked gravel in front), Fumi's; south of the road Ichiro the charcoal burner's house with his firewood stacked by it (its door round the front: down the path at x 19, along y 16). Ichiro's charcoal kiln (kiln, 2 x 2) stands below his house, its mouth to the front, two thumbprints in the clay over it (his father's and his); the kiln_mark prop on the same cells is the farmer's third, there once ichiro_mark is set (heart_ichiro_6), listed first so examining the kiln then reads its message. A bamboo grove north-east of the creek, where Ichiro cuts wood. Format: README.md, Maps.",
